# All creature types (CR 205.3m) are every one of them: the animated Soulstone Sanctuary is an Assassin, a Mercenary, a
# Pirate, a Rogue and a Warlock, so an outlaw (CR 700.12), and Bot2's Shoot the Sheriff ("Destroy target non-outlaw
# creature") can't target it. Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature of no outlaw type, is the control the spell is cast at.

[Bot1 Deck]
Soulstone Sanctuary
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Swamp
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Shoot the Sheriff
Swamp x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Soulstone Sanctuary.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Activate(Ability: {4})
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Types = Land; Creature
Bot1.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Shoot the Sheriff.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary)
Bot2.Hand.Shoot the Sheriff.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Soulstone Sanctuary.Types = Land; Creature
Bot2.Graveyard = Shoot the Sheriff; Ornithopter
